{"id":"torrey:goat-the","source":"torrey","name":"Goat, The","slug":"goat-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Clean and fit for food — De 14:4,5.","refs":[["Deut",14,4,14,4],["Deut",14,5,14,5]]},{"text":"Offered in sacrifice — Ge 15:9; Le 16:5,7.","refs":[["Gen",15,9,15,9],["Lev",16,5,16,5],["Lev",16,7,16,7]]},{"text":"The male, best for sacrifice — Le 22:19; Ps 50:9.","refs":[["Lev",22,19,22,19],["Ps",50,9,50,9]]},{"text":"First-born of, not redeemed — Nu 18:17.","refs":[["Num",18,17,18,17]]},{"text":"Jews had large flocks of — Ge 32:14; 1Sa 25:2.","refs":[["Gen",32,14,32,14],["1Sam",25,2,25,2]]},{"text":"Most profitable to the owner — Pr 27:26.","refs":[["Prov",27,26,27,26]]},{"text":"Milk of, used as food — Pr 27:27.","refs":[["Prov",27,27,27,27]]},{"text":"Called kids. — Ge 37:31.","refs":[["Gen",37,31,37,31]]},{"text":"Kept in small flocks. — 1Ki 20:27.","refs":[["1Kgs",20,27,20,27]]},{"text":"Fed near the shepherds’ tents. — Song 1:8.","refs":[["Song",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Not to be seethed in milk of mother. — Ex 23:19.","refs":[["Exod",23,19,23,19]]},{"text":"Offered in sacrifice. — Le 4:23; 5:6.","refs":[["Lev",4,23,4,23],["Lev",5,6,5,6]]},{"text":"Offered at the passover. — Ex 12:5; 2Ch 35:7.","refs":[["Exod",12,5,12,5],["2Chr",35,7,35,7]]},{"text":"Considered a delicacy. — Ge 27:9; Jdj 6:19.","refs":[["Gen",27,9,27,9],["Judg",6,19,6,19]]},{"text":"Given as a present. — Ge 38:17; Jdj 15:1.","refs":[["Gen",38,17,38,17],["Judg",15,1,15,1]]},{"text":"Offered for tabernacle. — Ex 25:4; 35:23.","refs":[["Exod",25,4,25,4],["Exod",35,23,35,23]]},{"text":"Made into curtains, for covering the tabernacle. — Ex 35:26; 36:14-18.","refs":[["Exod",35,26,35,26],["Exod",36,14,36,18]]},{"text":"Made into pillows. — 1Sa 19:13.","refs":[["1Sam",19,13,19,13]]},{"text":"Skin of, often used as clothing — Heb 11:37.","refs":[["Heb",11,37,11,37]]},{"text":"Bashan celebrated for — De 32:14.","refs":[["Deut",32,14,32,14]]},{"text":"The Arabians traded in — Eze 27:21.","refs":[["Ezek",27,21,27,21]]},{"text":"Flocks of, always led by a male — Jer 50:8.","refs":[["Jer",50,8,50,8]]},{"text":"When wild dwelt in the hills and rocks — 1Sa 24:2; Job 39:1; Ps 104:18.","refs":[["1Sam",24,2,24,2],["Job",39,1,39,1],["Ps",104,18,104,18]]},{"text":"Of Macedonian empire. — Da 8:5,21.","refs":[["Dan",8,5,8,5],["Dan",8,21,8,21]]},{"text":"Of the wicked. — Zec 10:3; Mt 25:32,33.","refs":[["Zech",10,3,10,3],["Matt",25,32,25,32],["Matt",25,33,25,33]]},{"text":"(Flock of,) of the church. — Song 4:1.","refs":[["Song",4,1,4,1]]}],"refCount":42}
